rt_index":12,"tongjian_id":"949453ec-db0e-11ef-80d0-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"夷","place_name_jianti_auto":"夷","resolved_place_entity_id":348,"start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"949453ed-db0e-11ef-b91e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/十一、姚安府（卷一百十六）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"。自晋至梁，皆为晋宁郡治。唐贞观二十二年，平西爨，开青蛉...","context_before":"...县境有蛮曰栋蚕。王莽时，益州郡蛮栋蚕、若豆等起兵杀郡守。","source_end_index":90,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"a49c9329-6530-554b-a729-74b1401f6be2","source_start_index":56,"source_text":"后汉建武十八年，栋蚕与姑复、叶榆、弄栋、连然诸种叛，杀长吏，寻击平之"}],"path":"云南方舆纪要/十一、姚安府（卷一百十六）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/二十一、永昌府（卷一百十八）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"永平十二年，哀牢内附，置永昌郡，西南益少事。及晋末，而群...","context_before":"...，始通中国。《华阳国志》：武帝度澜沧水，置不韦县。是也。","source_end_index":83,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"e84e043b-a106-5c0f-8e1f-db68c1d0b798","source_start_index":45,"source_text":"东汉建武中，西南夷栋蚕叛，诏刘尚讨之。尚追破之于不韦，斩栋蚕帅，西南夷悉平。"},{"context_after":"永平中，置永昌郡，治此。晋初因之，元康后荒废。《水经注》...","context_before":"...相吕嘉宗族以实之，名曰不韦，彰其先人恶行也。本属益州郡。","source_end_index":93,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"05763d24-6cb7-5a65-9d87-13ad0c1c287f","source_start_index":63,"source_text":"后汉建武二十一年，刘尚讨栋蚕叛蛮，破之，追至不韦，诸蛮悉平。"}],"path":"云南方舆纪要/二十一、永昌府（卷一百十八）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["军事"],"content":"1春，正月，追至不韋，斬棟蠶帥，西南諸夷悉平。","content_fanyi":"春季，正月，刘尚率军追击西南夷到不韦县，斩杀栋蚕首领，西南诸夷全部平定。","content_jianti_auto":"1春，正月，追至不韦，斩栋蚕帅，西南诸夷悉平。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":3414,"number":1,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"949453d0-db0e-11ef-bb1d-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"代郡","place_name_ji